  "_deferred-to-the-publications-pass": {
    "_about": [
      "234 photographs (arbre-*.jpg, foret-*.jpg, electronique-*.jpg),",
      "104 generated SVG figures (carte-*.svg, gabarit-carte.svg) and the",
      "generated HTML fragments (_carte-*.html, _annexe-tech.html,",
      "_accessoires-table.html).",
      "",
      "These are renamed with the publications, not before, for two",
      "reasons. The figures and fragments are GENERATED (C-45): their names",
      "come from gen_board.py, gen_sch.py and the build scripts, so the",
      "generator changes first and the files follow. And every one of them",
      "is referenced from the HTML fragments that the publications pass",
      "rewrites anyway — renaming them twice would be work done twice."
    ]
  }
